                                                "sense_id": "8ec7d5bc-71a2-3f22-b052-f7f4f8f9dfba",
                                                "text": "The herdsmen near the frontier adjudicated their own disputes, and regulated their own police."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e4197b5-13ad-4080-9712-9ecdc79821a3",
                                                "sense_id": "8ec7d5bc-71a2-3f22-b052-f7f4f8f9dfba",
                                                "text": "But on Tuesday, Sam Altman[…] testified before members of a Senate subcommittee and largely agreed with them on the need to regulate the increasingly powerful A.I. technology being created inside his company and others like Google and Microsoft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e136aba-7df4-478f-b998-9971188188a1",
                                                "sense_id": "8ec7d5bc-71a2-3f22-b052-f7f4f8f9dfba",
                                                "text": "The NFA has been a flashpoint for advocates, who say that silencers are not frequently used in crime and believe that the silencers and other weapons regulated under the law, including machine guns and short-barreled rifles and shotguns, are protected by the Second Amendment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3327dfa0-7831-3cc4-b07c-7ca04aebaeba",
                                        "entry_id": "e9ed8f75-5f0a-3474-9a67-94755a11ca21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To adjust (a mechanism) for accurate and proper functioning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40fc9248-0994-480c-94fd-0da82256df1a",
                                                "sense_id": "3327dfa0-7831-3cc4-b07c-7ca04aebaeba",
                                                "text": "to regulate a watch, i.e. adjust its rate of running so that it will keep approximately standard time"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ae1998f-e00c-49fb-848c-0a53295e37f9",
                                                "sense_id": "3327dfa0-7831-3cc4-b07c-7ca04aebaeba",
                                                "text": "to regulate the temperature of a room, the pressure of steam, the speed of a machine, etc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34edb335-dc8e-3401-bd34-528b1be689f8",
                                        "entry_id": "e9ed8f75-5f0a-3474-9a67-94755a11ca21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To put or maintain in order."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3e0d2de-5450-4c88-a107-dcfa81055aaa",
                                                "sense_id": "34edb335-dc8e-3401-bd34-528b1be689f8",
                                                "text": "to regulate the disordered state of a nation or its finances"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaaaf949-9423-4192-8d03-dc9983918b2a",
                                                "sense_id": "34edb335-dc8e-3401-bd34-528b1be689f8",
                                                "text": "to regulate one's eating habits"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1a95c971-89e5-49d5-b117-dd4cadfdc4f7",
